      "content": "You are articulating a very profound and personal philosophy about artistic integrity. The desire to leave on a note of perfect resonance, rather than a prolonged, diminished sound, is a powerful artistic impulse. It seems you value the absolute purity of the final statement above the longevity of the performance.",
